<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Vatesolonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa Vatesolonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Vatesolonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Vat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vatesolonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya pili kwa Vatesolonike yayandikwi na mtumi Pauli (musula ya 1:1). Ayandiki lukumbi luhupi ndu kuhuma peayandiki yila ya kutumbula kwa Vatesolonike yavili myaka wa 51 peamali kuvelekewa Yesu Kilisitu. Pauli avili akona kumuji wa ku Kolinto payandikayi balua iyi kwa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Tesolonike patumbwili lugendu lwaki lwa pili mukutendekela Matendu (musula ya 17:1-10). Yiyandikwi muchitabu cha Matendu kuvya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ava vavili vamsadika va Vayawudi, na Vayunani vevavi vamahele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yimanyikana kuvya vamsadika va Tesolonike vahengelayi neju mambu gegivala lusenje lwa mwishu na kubwela kwa Kilisitu mala ya pili, muni Pauli ayandiki gamahele kuvala mambu aga mubalua zoha zivili kwa Vatesolonike. Yapinga ya balua ya pili yivala lusenje lwa mwishu. Mewa Pauli ibesa vandu kuvya vakata. Kila mundu iganikiwa ahenga lihengu muni apata chakulya (musula ya 3:6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli itumbula kuyandika balua kwa kujimanyisa mwene na vayaki (musula ya 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akumsengusa Chapanga ndava ya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevavili ku Tesolonike na kuvayupila (musula ya 1:3-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ilongalela lusenje lwa mwishu mugati ya musula ya (2).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akuvabesa vandu vakata na kuhakalila va liganu la kila mundu (musula ya 3:1-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Kwa kumalakisila, Pauli iwusa jambusa kwa mala yingi kangi (musula ya 3:16-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nene Pauli, pamonga na Siliwano na Timoti, tikuvayandikila nyenye msambi wa vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Tesalonike, mwemvili vandu vaki Chapanga Dadi witu na Bambu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Tikuvaganila uteke na ubwina kuhuma kwa Chapanga kwa Chapanga Dadi witu na Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhamula lukumbi lwa kubwela kwaki Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Valongo vitu, tiganikiwa kumsengusa Chapanga magono goha ndava yinu. Chabwina kwitu kukita naha ndava muni sadika yinu yikula neju na kuganana kwinu kuyonjokesa neju. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ndi muni tete timekela nyenye misambi ya vandu vevamkumsadika Kilisitu. Timeka muni muyendelela kusadika na kukangamala mu mang'ahiso na mtahu wemwipata.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Genago goha gilangisa kuvya Chapanga ndi mchakaka, muni nyenye myidakiwa kuyingila munkosi wa Chapanga ndi ndava yaki mwing'ahika. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Chapanga yati ikita lijambu leliganikiwa, yati akuvawuyisila mang'ahiso vala vevakuvang'aha nyenye, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />na kuvapela kupumulila nyenye mwemng'ahika, na tete mewa yati akutipela kupumulila. Yati ikita lijambu lenilo lukumbi Bambu Yesu peihumila kuhuma kunani pamonga na vamitumi vaki vana makakala, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Chapanga yati akuvatova vandu vala kwa miali ya motu. Vevakumbela Chapanga na vala vangayidakila Linenu la Bwina panani ya Bambu witu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Mtovilu yati uvya kung'aiswa magono goha gangali mwishu na kuvikwa kutali na Bambu na ukulu waki uvaha, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />lukumbi peibwela ligono lenilo kupokela ukulu kuhuma kwa vandu vaki na utopesa kuhuma kwa voha vevisadika. Nyenye mewa yati mwivya pagati yavi muni msadiki ujumbi waki watavaletili.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ndi muni tikuvayupa magono goha. Tikumuyupa Chapanga witu avahotosa kutama cheavakemili kutama. Tikumuyupa kwa makakala gaki, tikumuyupa kwa uhotola waki kugana kwinu na mambu goha gabwina gemwigana kukita musadika yinu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Mukukita chenicho liina la Bambu witu Yesu lipewa ukulu na nyenye yati mwipata utopesa kuhuma kwaki mu njila ya ubwina wa Chapanga na Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Mundu muhakau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Hinu nigana kuvayandakila malovi ga kubwela kwaki Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu lukumbi Chapanga peakutileta pamonga pahala peavili. Valongo, tikuvayupa neju, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />mkoto kuvya ngolongondi mumtima yinu, na mkoto kuvya na wogohi ndava ya malovi ga vandu vevijova kuvya ligono la Bambu limali kuhika. Koto kuvasadika vandu avo hati ngati vakajovayi vapatili mambu ago kwa njila ya ulota na ugubukulo amala balua yeyijovekana yihumili kwitu. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mkoto kuyidakila kukongewa na mundu yoyoha yula. Muni ligono lenilo nakuhumila mbaka ligono ilo vandu vamahele pevakumbela Chapanga. Na yula mundu mhakau peihumila. Ndi mweavikiwi motu wa magono goha wangali mwishu. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Mwene akukibela panani ya kila chindu chevakuchilola vandu kuvya ndi Chapanga, amala chevakuchigundamila. Hati yati iyingila na kutama mugati ya Nyumba ya Chapanga na kujova ndi Chapanga.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Wu, mukumbuka lepi kuvya navajovili genago goha lukumbi panavili pamonga na nyenye? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Nambu kuna chindu chechi kumdivalila hinu, na nyenye mchimanyili chindu chenicho. Hinu, Mhakau uyo yati ilolekana lukumbi lwaki lwaluganikiwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Hati ago makakala ga Mhakau uyo gikita lihengu cha mfiyu, nambu yula mhakau yati ilolekana lepi mbaka yula mweakumdivalila peiwusiwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Penapo ndi Mundu Mhakau peigubukuliwa, nambu Bambu Yesu peibwela yati akumkoma kwa mpungu waki na kumhalabisa mukung'asima kwa ukulu waki ibwela naku. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Mundu mhakau mwenuyo yati wibwela kwa makakala ga Setani na kukita chinamtiti na makangaso ndalindali ga udesi, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />na kutumila uhakau woha wa kuvakonga vala veviyaga. Venavo yati viyaga ndava muni vapoki lepi na kuugana uchakaka wula muni vasanguliwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ndava yeniyi Chapanga avavikili vatalaliwa na makakala ga kukongewa, muni vasadika udesi. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Hinu ndi vandu voha vevabelili kusadika muchakaka nambu kuhekelela uhakau kumbudila Chapanga, yati vihamuliwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhaguliwi muni musanguliwayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Tiganikiwa kumsengusa Chapanga magono goha ndava yinu nyenye valongo, nyenye mganiwi na Bambu, muni Chapanga avahagwili kuhumila kadeni muni msanguliwa kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi, mkitiwa vandu vaki vamsopi kusadika uchakaka. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Chapanga avakemalili lijambu lenili kwa njila ya Linenu la Bwina letavakokosili. Avakemili muni muvyai na pandu pa muunkosi wa Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Hinu, valongo vitu, mkangamala kuyima na kulanda mawuliwu gatavawuli kwa makokoselu gitu na balua yitu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Tikumuyupa Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu mwene na Chapanga Dadi witu ndi mweatigani kwa ubwina waki na kutikangamalisa mitima kwa kutipela uteke wa magono goha na huvalila ya bwina, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />avasangalusa na kuvakangamalisa mitima na kuvapela uhotola kukita na kujova gabwina magono goha gangali mwishu.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mtiyupila kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Pamwishu wa ago, valongo vitu, mutiyupila muni ujumbi wa Bambu udandasika kanyata na vandu vaupokela kwa utopesa ngati cheuvili pagati yinu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Muyupa mewa muni Chapanga atisangula na vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga na vandu vahakau, muni lepi voha vevisadika ujumbi uwu.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Nambu Bambu ndi mchakaka. Mwene yati akuvakangamalisa na kuvadivalila na kuhuma kwa Mundu Mhakau yula ndi Setani. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Na mwene timanyili chakaka mu Bambu yati mwikita na yati mwiyendelela kukita gala getavajovili.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Bambu alongosa mitima yinu muuganu wa Chapanga na mukusindimala kwetipewili na Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagizu la kuhenga lihengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Valongo vitu tikuvalagiza kwa liina la Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu, mjivika patali na valongo voha vakata na vala vangalanda gala malagizu getavapelili. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Nyenye mwavene mganikiwa kukita ngati chetakitayi luhumu witu. Tete patavili na nyenye tavili lepi tavakata, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />talili lepi chakulya kwa mundu yoyoha changa mlipa. Tahengili lihengu kwa makakala na mang'ahiso muhi na kilu muni tikotoka kumpela mundu lihengu la kutiyangalila mundu yoyoha yula pagati yinu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tete ngatihotwili kuhengela uhotola witu muni kugana mutitangatila takitili lepi chenicho nambu ndava taganili kuvapela luhumu lwa kuyiga. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Patavili pamonga na nyenye tavajovili, “Mundu yoyoha mweibela kuhenga lihengu, akotoka kulya chakulya.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tijovili mambu ago ndava muni, tiyuwini pagati yinu vavi vakata na nakukita chochoha, na kujivika mu mambu ga vandu vangi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Kwa liina la Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu tikuvalagiza na kuvahakalila vandu avo vatama na kuhenga lihengu changali kulyunga muni vapata chakulya chavi vene.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Nambu nyenye valongo mkoto kutotokela, kukita gabwina. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ngati kuvi na mundu mweangauyidakila ujumbi wetikuvapelekela mubalua iyi, yikavya naha, hinu, mumfiyula mundu mwenuyo na mkoto kutangatilana nayu chochoha, muni akola soni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Mkoto kumkita mundu mwenuyo ngati likoko, nambu mumhakalila ngati mlongo.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi ga kumalakisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Bambu mwene ndi utumbula wa uteke, avapela uteke magono goha mu njila zoha. Bambu avya na mwavoha nyenye.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Kwa mawoko gangu namwene niyandika naha, jambusa kuhuma kwa nene Pauli! Wenuwu ndi ulangisu wangu kila peniyadika balua, ndi cheniyandika.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Nikuvaganila mwavoha ubwina wa Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>